# sortFunction

- _sortFunction([x₁ x₂ …])_

Answer the sort function of the sorted list _x_.

```
>>> SortedList[1 3 5 7 9]
>>> .sortFunction
>>> .name
'precedes/2'

>>> SortedList([1 3 5 7 9], <)
>>> .sortFunction
>>> .operatorName
'<'
```

* * *

See also: SortedList

